  </div>
</div></div></div><div class="views-field views-field-title"><h2 class="field-content"><a href="/node/597" hreflang="en">Records Retention Policy Impacts Old SAM Registration Data</a></h2></div><div class="views-field views-field-body"><div class="field-content"><p>In accordance with GSA records retention policy, SAM.gov registration data older than ten (10) years is to be destroyed. Read more about it in <a href="/announcements/entity-records-retention">the full announcement</a>.</p></div></div><div class="views-field views-field-field-alert-published-date"><div class="field-content">Published Date: May 21, 2025</div></div><div class="views-field views-field-field-alert-end-date views-field-date"><div class="field-content"><span> End Date: </span> <span>Indefinite  
